# BNS Phase 4: Flutter UI 기본 구조

## Context

Phase 1-3에서 FreeLang 서버 1,447줄 완성 (7파일).
- `/api/status`: MEMORY.md 동적 파싱
- `/api/gogs`: git log 동적 파싱  
- `/api/feed`: SSE 브로드캐스트 (100 tick 폴링)
- `/api/db`: DB 상태 통계

Phase 4 목표: "폰 화면이 실시간 업데이트" — BNS API를 소비하는 Flutter Android 앱.
**Termux에 Flutter 미설치** 상태이므로, 1단계로 Dart 모델/서비스/화면 코드 작성,
실제 빌드는 flutter create 후 복사 방식으로 진행.

---

## 변경 범위

### 신규 디렉토리 (1개)
```
projects/bns-flutter/
├── pubspec.yaml             ← Flutter 의존성 선언
├── lib/
│   ├── main.dart            ← MaterialApp, BottomNavigationBar
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── project_status.dart
│   │   ├── gogs_commit.dart
│   │   ├── sse_event.dart
│   │   └── db_status.dart
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── api_service.dart  ← HTTP GET 공통 처리
│   │   └── sse_service.dart  ← /api/feed 폴링 Stream
│   └── screens/
│       ├── status_screen.dart
│       ├── gogs_screen.dart
│       ├── feed_screen.dart
│       └── db_screen.dart
```

---

## API → Dart 모델 매핑

### /api/status 응답 → project_status.dart
```json
{
  "last_update": "2026-03-29",
  "projects": [{"name":"Zero-Copy-DB","phase":11,"lines":22439,"files":56,"tests":182,"status":"✅ COMPLETE"}],
  "total_lines": 26874,
  "total_tests": 262
}
```
```dart
class ProjectStatus {
  final String name; final int phase, lines, files, tests; final String status;
}
class ApiStatusResponse {
  final String lastUpdate; final List<ProjectStatus> projects; final int totalLines, totalTests;
}
```

### /api/gogs 응답 → gogs_commit.dart
```json
{"repo_count":6,"total_commits":100,"recent_commits":[{"hash":"2fcb909","message":"...","repo":"...","date":"2026-03-29","files_changed":2,"insertions":89,"deletions":45}]}
```
```dart
class GogsCommit {
  final String hash, message, repo, date; final int filesChanged, insertions, deletions;
}
class ApiGogsResponse {
  final List<GogsCommit> recentCommits; final int repoCount, totalCommits;
}
```

### /api/feed SSE → sse_event.dart
```
Content-Type: text/event-stream
data: {"status":"waiting","message":"No events yet"}\n\n
```
> ⚠️ BNS 서버 내부 구현: 100 tick 폴링 후 단건 응답 반환 (진정한 long-lived 스트림 아님)
> Flutter: 3초 간격 GET 폴링으로 구현 (EventSource 대신)
```dart
class SseEvent {
  final String? eventType, message; final String? status;
  bool get isWaiting => status == 'waiting';
}
```

### /api/db 응답 → db_status.dart
```json
{"name":"Zero-Copy-DB","phase":11,"modules":11,"total_lines":22439,"memory_usage_mb":8.5,"active_transactions":3,"cached_queries":12,"performance":{"query_latency_ms":2.5,"insert_throughput_per_sec":5000,"index_hit_rate":0.94}}
```
```dart
class DbPerformance { final double queryLatencyMs, indexHitRate; final int insertThroughputPerSec; }
class DbStatus { final String name; final int phase, modules, totalLines, activeTransactions, cachedQueries; final double memoryUsageMb; final DbPerformance performance; }
```

---

## 구현 상세

### 1. pubspec.yaml
```yaml
name: bns_flutter
environment:
  sdk: '>=3.0.0 <4.0.0'
dependencies:
  flutter:
    sdk: flutter
  http: ^1.2.0       # REST API 호출
  provider: ^6.1.0   # 상태 관리
```

### 2. ApiService (lib/services/api_service.dart)
```dart
const _base = 'http://localhost:28080';  // BNS 서버 (in-process: 향후 실 주소)

Future<ApiStatusResponse> fetchStatus() async {
  final r = await http.get(Uri.parse('$_base/api/status'));
  return ApiStatusResponse.fromJson(jsonDecode(r.body));
}
Future<ApiGogsResponse> fetchGogs() async { ... }
Future<DbStatus> fetchDb() async { ... }
```

### 3. SseService (lib/services/sse_service.dart)
```dart
// BNS /api/feed는 100 tick 후 단건 반환 → 3초 폴링으로 대체
Stream<SseEvent> feedStream() async* {
  while (true) {
    try {
      final r = await http.get(Uri.parse('$_base/api/feed'))
          .timeout(Duration(seconds: 10));
      final raw = r.body.replaceFirst('data: ', '').trim();
      yield SseEvent.fromJson(jsonDecode(raw));
    } catch (_) {
      yield SseEvent.waiting();
    }
    await Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: 3));
  }
}
```

### 4. main.dart (BottomNavigationBar 4탭)
```dart
class BnsApp extends StatefulWidget { ... }
// 4개 탭: 📊 Status | 🔧 Commits | 📡 Feed | 💾 DB
